---
export interface Props {
  class?: string;
}
const { class: className = "" } = Astro.props;
---

<!-- Executive FAQ - Mobile Optimized -->
<section
  class={`py-16 sm:py-24 px-4 sm:px-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-50 to-white ${className}`}
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center mb-8 sm:mb-12">
      <h2
        class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3 sm:mb-4"
        data-aos="fade-up"
      >
        Executive Briefing: Your Questions Answered
      </h2>
      <p
        class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-gray-600"
        data-aos="fade-up"
        data-aos-delay="100"
      >
        Direct answers to what CEOs, CFOs, and HR leaders ask us
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-3 sm:space-y-4">
      <details
        class="group bg-white rounded-xl shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow"
        data-aos="fade-up"
      >
        <summary
          class="px-4 sm:px-6 py-3 sm:py-4 cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center"
        >
          <span class="font-semibold text-base sm:text-lg text-gray-900 pr-2"
            >"What's our implementation risk?"</span
          >
          <svg
            class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-500 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform flex-shrink-0"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          >
            <path
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              stroke-width="2"
              d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path>
          </svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-4 sm:px-6 pb-3 sm:pb-4">
          <div
            class="space-y-2 sm:space-y-3 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-700"
          >
            <p>
              • <strong>Zero disruption</strong> to existing plans - this is an overlay
              benefit
            </p>
            <p>
              • <strong>30-day implementation</strong> with dedicated project manager
            </p>
            <p>
              • <strong>Pilot program option</strong> to test with subset of employees
            </p>
            <p>
              • <strong>No IT burden</strong> - we handle all technical requirements
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-3 sm:mt-4 p-2 sm:p-3 bg-green-50 rounded-lg">
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-green-800">
              <strong>De-risked:</strong> Built by the team that recruited and managed
              a 1,200+ center imaging network.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details
        class="group bg-white rounded-xl shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow"
        data-aos="fade-up"
        data-aos-delay="100"
      >
        <summary
          class="px-4 sm:px-6 py-3 sm:py-4 cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center"
        >
          <span class="font-semibold text-base sm:text-lg text-gray-900 pr-2"
            >"How do we ensure quality isn't compromised?"</span
          >
          <svg
            class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-500 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform flex-shrink-0"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          >
            <path
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              stroke-width="2"
              d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path>
          </svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-4 sm:px-6 pb-3 sm:pb-4">
          <div
            class="space-y-2 sm:space-y-3 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-700"
          >
            <p>
              • <strong>ACR accreditation required</strong> for all facilities (same
              as hospitals)
            </p>
            <p>
              • <strong>Board-certified radiologists only</strong> - no exceptions
            </p>
            <p>
              • <strong>Real-time quality scoring</strong> with member feedback loop
            </p>
            <p>
              • <strong>Same facilities</strong> your employees already use - just
              better pricing
            </p>
            <p>• <strong>24/7 support line</strong> for any member concerns</p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-3 sm:mt-4 p-2 sm:p-3 bg-blue-50 rounded-lg">
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-blue-800">
              <strong>Track record:</strong> 98% satisfaction across 150,000+ imaging
              services delivered
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details
        class="group bg-white rounded-xl shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow"
        data-aos="fade-up"
        data-aos-delay="200"
      >
        <summary
          class="px-4 sm:px-6 py-3 sm:py-4 cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center"
        >
          <span class="font-semibold text-base sm:text-lg text-gray-900 pr-2"
            >"What's the actual ROI timeline?"</span
          >
          <svg
            class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-500 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform flex-shrink-0"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          >
            <path
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              stroke-width="2"
              d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path>
          </svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-4 sm:px-6 pb-3 sm:pb-4">
          <div
            class="space-y-2 sm:space-y-3 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-700"
          >
            <p>
              • <strong>Day 1:</strong> Immediate savings on every redirected scan
              (75-90% reduction)
            </p>
            <p>
              • <strong>Month 1:</strong> Measurable increase in employee utilization
            </p>
            <p>
              • <strong>Month 3:</strong> 75-90% total imaging cost reduction visible
            </p>
            <p>
              • <strong>Month 6:</strong> Faster diagnosis shortens time away from
              work
            </p>
            <p>
              • <strong>Year 1:</strong> Full ROI including productivity and satisfaction
              gains
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details
        class="group bg-white rounded-xl shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow"
        data-aos="fade-up"
        data-aos-delay="300"
      >
        <summary
          class="px-4 sm:px-6 py-3 sm:py-4 cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center"
        >
          <span class="font-semibold text-base sm:text-lg text-gray-900 pr-2"
            >"Does this bolt on to our existing plan?"</span
          >
          <svg
            class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-500 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform flex-shrink-0"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          >
            <path
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              stroke-width="2"
              d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path>
          </svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-4 sm:px-6 pb-3 sm:pb-4">
          <div
            class="space-y-2 sm:space-y-3 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-700"
          >
            <p>
              • <strong>No network conflicts</strong> - this is a supplemental benefit
            </p>
            <p>
              • <strong>White-label options</strong> available for branded experience
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-3 sm:mt-4 p-2 sm:p-3 bg-purple-50 rounded-lg">
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-purple-800">
              <strong>Partnership approach:</strong> We enhance your existing relationships,
              not replace them
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details
        class="group bg-white rounded-xl shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow"
        data-aos="fade-up"
        data-aos-delay="400"
      >
        <summary
          class="px-4 sm:px-6 py-3 sm:py-4 cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center"
        >
          <span class="font-semibold text-base sm:text-lg text-gray-900 pr-2"
            >"What about compliance and regulatory issues?"</span
          >
          <svg
            class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-500 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform flex-shrink-0"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          >
            <path
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              stroke-width="2"
              d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path>
          </svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-4 sm:px-6 pb-3 sm:pb-4">
          <div
            class="space-y-2 sm:space-y-3 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-700"
          >
            <p>
              • <strong>Plan Structure</strong> - Designed as a supplemental
              benefit that operates alongside your existing plan. Your benefits
              counsel should confirm fit with your plan documents.
            </p>
            <p>
              • <strong>Data Security</strong> - Secure portal-based handling of
              sensitive health information.
            </p>
            <p>
              • <strong>Legal review included</strong> - we provide all documentation
            </p>
            <p>
              • <strong>Verified Facilities</strong> - Active network locations
              complete USRad verification requirements for licensure, insurance,
              accreditation, and service capability.
            </p>
            <p>
              • <strong>Direct Contracting</strong> - USRad can contract directly
              with self-funded employers without requiring a carrier network
              arrangement.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details
        class="group bg-white rounded-xl shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow"
        data-aos="fade-up"
        data-aos-delay="500"
      >
        <summary
          class="px-4 sm:px-6 py-3 sm:py-4 cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center"
        >
          <span class="font-semibold text-base sm:text-lg text-gray-900 pr-2"
            >"When do we pay USRad?"</span
          >
          <svg
            class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-500 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform flex-shrink-0"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          >
            <path
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              stroke-width="2"
              d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path>
          </svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-4 sm:px-6 pb-3 sm:pb-4">
          <div
            class="space-y-2 sm:space-y-3 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-700"
          >
            <p>
              • <strong>Funded before scheduling</strong> - your funds are in place
              before any member is routed to an imaging center
            </p>
            <p>
              • <strong>No claims, no invoicing cycle</strong> - imaging centers are
              paid by USRad on a fixed schedule, not by your plan
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-3 sm:mt-4 p-2 sm:p-3 bg-green-50 rounded-lg">
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-green-800">
              <strong>Prefunded model:</strong> USRad routes only funded assignments
              — there is no accounts receivable between your plan and the imaging
              center
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
